<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body aria-readonly="false" style="height:auto;
			 min-height:auto;
			 margin:0;
			 padding:0;
			 background-color:#ffffff;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
			  border-collapse:collapse;
			  background-color:#ffffff;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:760px;
							  width:100%;
							  background-color:#ffffff;
							  border:2px solid #c9a75d;
							  border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" style="display:block;
											width:100%;
											max-width:100%;
											height:auto;
											border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Welcome to <strong>Arelia</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>{{{Recipient.Name}}}</strong>!</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">We’re delighted to have you with us. Your registration has been completed successfully, and your design journey begins here.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Here is a quick summary of the details we have received:</p> <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;"><strong>Your Registration Details:</strong></p>
          <ul style="margin-top:8px;
										   margin-bottom:24px;
										   padding-left:24px;">
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">Name:&nbsp;<strong>{{{Recipient.Name}}}</strong></li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">Email:&nbsp;<strong>{{{Recipient.Email}}}</strong></li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;">Phone:&nbsp;<strong>{{{Recipient.Phone}}}</strong></li>
          </ul>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin-bottom:20px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
													   padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:20px;
														  line-height:1.4;
														  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
														  color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>What happens next?</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">To continue with your interior project, please click on the link below and share your project details:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:8px;
										   margin-bottom:22px;
										   padding-left:24px;">
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;"><strong>Project Type</strong> – Residential or Commercial</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;"><strong>Property Details</strong> – Rooms, size, and layout</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;"><strong>Budget &amp; Design Preferences</strong> – Your expectations and design preferences</li>
           <li style="margin-bottom:8px;
											   font-size:18px;
											   line-height:1.5;
											   font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
											   color:#222222;"><strong>Additional Requirements</strong> – Any special requirements you would like us to consider</li>
          </ul> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">These details will help our team understand your vision and plan the next steps.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;
											  margin:22px 0 24px 0;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#1b1b1b;
													   border:1px solid #c9a75d;
													   padding:12px 24px;
													   text-align:center;"><a href="{{{ProjectRequestLink}}}" style="font-size:17px;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#ffffff;
														  text-decoration:none;
														  font-weight:bold;
														  display:inline-block;">Share Project Details </a></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Our team will review your information after you complete the next step and get in touch with you to discuss suggestions, timelines, and design options.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Thank you for choosing <strong>Arelia</strong>. We look forward to bringing your vision to life.</p> <p style="margin:0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Warm regards,<br /> <strong>Team Arelia</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
									   border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
									   padding:28px 32px 24px 32px;
									   text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
										  font-size:24px;
										  line-height:1.3;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#D6B36A;
										  font-weight:bold;
										  text-align:center;">AreliaSpace</p> <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;
										  font-size:11px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
										  color:#C99A3D;
										  letter-spacing:2px;
										  text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
													   padding:18px 10px 0 10px;
													   text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;
														  font-size:13px;
														  line-height:1.7;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#D3C6B5;
														  text-align:center;">At AreliaSpace, we craft timeless interiors that reflect your personality and elevate the way you live.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
														  font-size:15px;
														  line-height:1.5;
														  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
														  font-style:italic;
														  color:#D6B36A;
														  text-align:center;">Designing Spaces. Creating Experiences.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
											  border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #3f3527;
													   border-bottom:1px solid #3f3527;
													   padding:15px 10px;
													   text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
														  font-size:13px;
														  line-height:1.6;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#D3C6B5;
														  text-align:center;">Need assistance? Simply reply to this email and our team will be happy to help.</p> <p style="margin:0;
														  font-size:12px;
														  line-height:1.6;
														  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
														  color:#AFA79D;
														  text-align:center;">We’re here to support you throughout your design journey.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:16px 0 5px 0;
										  font-size:11px;
										  line-height:1.6;
										  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
										  color:#8F887F;
										  text-align:center;">This email was sent because you recently registered with AreliaSpace.</p> <p style="margin:0;
										  font-size:11px;
										  line-height:1.6;
										  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
										  color:#8F887F;
										  text-align:center;">© 2026 AreliaSpace. All rights reserved.</p></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
</html>